i/Tyr\" title=\"Tyr\">Tyr</a> saw the world's injustice, though his eyes were blind.\n</p><p>On the Second Day, Torm was slain and returned to serve the truth.\n</p><p>On the Third Day, <a href=\"/wiki/Ilmater\" title=\"Ilmater\">Ilmater</a> wept for all that came before - and all that was to come.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715075735\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1391/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23527/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5463/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930919/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.466      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   37.466      1 -total\n 49.87%   18.686      6 Template:Icon_text\n 44.22%   16.567     15 Template:Trim\n 23.92%    8.962      2 Template:Uid\n 16.35%    6.125      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.03%    5.255      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.50%    3.934      1 Template:Books\n 10.45%    3.914      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.27%    3.847      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31100-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715075735 and revision id 240614. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}